OL,3,ATrump says Nvidia boss told him he had
OL,4,Ano idea woman he had affair with was
OL,5,AChinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump has said the boss of
OL,8,FNvidia, whose affair with an alleged
OL,9,FChinese spy is being investigated, told
OL,10,Fhim that he had "no idea she was a
OL,11,Fspy".
OL,13,FThe US President said he spoke with CEO
OL,14,FJensen Huang on Monday following
OL,15,Freports that the US believed he had
OL,16,Fbeen targeted in a Chinese espionage
OL,17,Fcampaign.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
