OL,3,ATrump says Nvidia boss told him he had
OL,4,Ano idea woman he had affair with was
OL,5,AChinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I asked him that question, 'Did you
OL,8,Fhave any idea she was a spy?' He said
OL,9,F'I had no idea she was a spy' and I
OL,10,Freally believe him," Trump told
OL,11,Freporters.
OL,13,FTrump said the FBI was also
OL,14,Finvestigating the affair. China has
OL,15,Frejected claims that Huang was
OL,16,Ftargeted, with its foreign ministry
OL,17,Fsaying the allegations were "entirely
OL,18,Fgroundless, speculative and intended to
OL,19,Fsmear and malign China".
